        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Dog breeds: Stabyhoun, Stabij, Griffon Bruxellois, Griffon Belge, Petit Brabançon, Glen of Imaal Terrier\n- Concepts: rare dog breeds\n\nFacts:\n- The Stabyhoun, also called the Stabij, is one of the five rarest dog breeds in the world.\n- The Griffon Bruxellois may refer to three different breeds: the Griffon Bruxellois, the Griffon Belge, and the Petit Brabançon.\n- A rare dog breed is any dog breed that is small in number.\n- The term rare dog breed is used for both old established breeds such as the Stabyhoun and Glen of Imaal Terrier and newer creations.",
